          </p>

          <p>
            As with drills, the battery is the real purchase. If you already own a drill, buy the impact driver that fits its batteries. If you are starting from scratch, our <a href="/milwaukee-vs-dewalt/">Milwaukee vs DeWalt</a> comparison will help you pick a platform, and our <a href="/best-cordless-drill/">best cordless drill</a> guide picks the matching drill for each one.
